00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.501 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I'm so sorry.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just can't believe --
Sometimes, I just can't believ

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.839 size:75% position:38%
my life, and I think
