00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:22.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, we have my house
and then we have two barns

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:25.885
One is a nonworking barn, whic
is where there's just two sta-

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:27.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
what used to be stables
where people stay,

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:30.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, two bedrooms
