00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.130 size:75% position:38% line:92%
It's a working barn.

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:42.268
And, so, they're just, you know,
having fun.

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:45.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How many mini horses
do you have?

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:46.239 line:92%
-We have two mini horses.

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then we have a pony
and a donkey

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:52.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
