pretty large horses.

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Normal horses?

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So you have, like,
all the sizes of horses?

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:58.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Almost all.
You would be surprised.

00:01:58.585 --> 00:01:59.886 line:92%
There are a lot more sizes

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Were the mini --
What's the order you go in

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:02.889 line:92%
when you start buying horses

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:06.192
Do you start with big horses and
then you start talking about

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:06.960 line:92%
"Oh, you know what would be fun?

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
We got a little --
a couple mini horses."

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:11.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, is the mini horses
the last purchase?

00:02:11.231 --> 00:02:16.169
-I think -- No, actually
the donkey was the last --

00:02:16.169 --> 00:02:19.172 align:start size:94% position:6%
The last thing that we got
