we'll take them in, at any size.

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:29.716 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you do usually start wit
big horses, I think.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.217 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Be honest, Amanda.

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:32.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you get
the mini horses thinking

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:36.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
they were baby horses that wer
gonna grow into big horses

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:38.424 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
