00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:41.461 size:75% position:38%
No, I knew they were
going to stay small.

00:02:41.461 --> 00:02:43.296 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is -- I should point out
a couple things,

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:46.065
because I do feel like,
you know, in this the last year,

00:02:46.065 --> 00:02:47.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
