"You know what?

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
Forget city living.
I'm moving to a farm."

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:53.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
But this -- You've
been farm-living for a while

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:55.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I'm old hat now.
-Yeah.

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:58.044 size:84% position:42%
-We've been enrolled in
the school here, too.

00:02:58.044 --> 00:03:00.914
You know when your kids star
going to school somewhere,

00:03:00.914 --> 00:03:02.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
they've got to
kind of stay, right?

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:06.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
And you have 30 total animals.

00:03:06.819 --> 00:03:10.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, like 23.
-Like 23?

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like when you say "23,"
it's 23.

00:03:13.326 --> 00:03:15.995 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-24 1/2.

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.530 line:92%
-What -- And congratulations

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:19.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
In September,
you had your second baby.

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:20.667 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yep. Yeah, thanks.

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:24.137 size:84% position:42%
Yeah, I didn't have him
in a lobby, thank God.

00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:29.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. Well, I think, even
a lobby is probably, you know,

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:31.444 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
nicer than a barn.

00:03:31.444 --> 00:03:32.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're right.
No, it's good.

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:35.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
I still am
mesmerized by that story.

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:38.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so beautiful.
-It's a pretty good one.

00:03:38.518 --> 00:03:43.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you --
How old is your oldest?

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:44.958 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-She's like over 3 1/2.

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:49.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
