What does a 3-1/2-year-old -

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:52.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
Of your animals,
who is she most drawn to?

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:53.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The donkey.
-Okay.

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:54.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Everybody is in love
with the donkey.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And the donkey -- I think
we have a photo of the donkey.

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:59.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
The donkey is Gus?
-That's Gus, yeah.

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:00.173 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I get it.

00:04:00.173 --> 00:04:05.645
What is it about a donkey
that a child is drawn to?

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:10.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, I think there's
so much surface area

00:04:10.483 --> 00:04:11.851 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in his head.

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:13.453 line:92%
There's just so much space

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:16.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
