00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:20.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's very hard and flat
and fuzzy,

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:24.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
and horses don't necessarily
have that much space.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know why that's th
first thing I think of, but --

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:28.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I will be honest --
that answer was so much better

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:32.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
than what I expected,
that donkeys are beloved

00:04:32.705 --> 00:04:34.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
because of their
head surface area.

00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:37.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because I believe it abso-
As soon as you said it,

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:40.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
I realized that is true,
and this is clearly a person

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:44.417
who is spending a lot of tim
with many different farm animals

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:48.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
and taking stock of their
head surface area.

00:04:48.288 --> 00:04:51.991 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Too much time maybe?

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:57.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You guys -- I'm assuming
when you're at 23,

00:04:57.497 --> 00:05:00.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
