00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:49.182 size:81% position:41% line:92%
So don't get me wrong.

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:53.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, we'll leave it at that.
Internal issues.

00:05:53.586 --> 00:05:54.854 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't know why
