00:06:12.238 --> 00:06:17.276 align:start size:94% position:6%
She looks at me sideways
every single day.

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:17.877 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
Classic "oh, when you lose
a chicken,

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:21.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
