friend Amanda,

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:26.052 line:92%
it's probably internal issues.

00:06:26.052 --> 00:06:28.955 line:92%
Hey, this movie is wonderful

00:06:28.955 --> 00:06:33.459 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were so good in this film.
-Thanks.

00:06:33.459 --> 00:06:37.530
-Was it exciting to take o
this role of Marion Davies

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:38.231 line:92%
