00:07:09.495 --> 00:07:12.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I got to tell you,
really hard to find

00:07:12.064 --> 00:07:17.737
backstage interviews of he
when she's just herself.

00:07:17.737 --> 00:07:21.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, it was very daunting
very exciting,

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:24.243 align:start size:94% position:6%
definitely the
biggest challenge to date.

00:07:24.243 --> 00:07:27.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
