obviously, directing it,

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:30.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know, his reputatio
precedes himself.

00:07:30.249 --> 00:07:33.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
And most of your work in the
film is with Gary Oldman.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:36.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it -- You know,
was it an inviting set?

00:07:36.389 --> 00:07:39.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was it -- Did you feel ver
taken care of

00:07:39.025 --> 00:07:42.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
